==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|shrĭ'vəl}}, {{IPA|/ˈʃrɪvəl/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-shrivel.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɪvəl|lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|shrivell}} (''UK'')
{{en-verb}} (''US'')

# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} To [[collapse]] inward; to [[crumble]].
#: ''I saw him '''shrivel''' on the ground in fear.''
# {{context|intransitive|lang=en}} To become [[wrinkled]].
#: ''His fingers were '''shriveled''' from being in the bath for too long.''
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To draw into [[wrinkle]]s.
#: ''The hot sun '''shrivelled''' the leaves.''

